000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          CTSTOVRID
000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        MAY, 1990.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000900*REMARKS.   CALLED BY 'TTSTOVRID' TO TEST FILE OVERRIDES/FILE
001000*           POINTER/FILE BUFFER BEHAVIOR.
001100*
001200 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001300 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002000 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

001700 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500 OF MCFLCS0501.

001900
001800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

       COPY MPLT0 IN COPYCSIS.

012700 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
012900 6000-MAIN.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I.
           MOVE "*006" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "ERROR READING PLTINFOKEY IN CTSTOVERID".
           CLOSE MPLTINFO-I.
        6990-MAIN-X.
            GOBACK.
